    "https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/blob/main/receiver/hostmetricsreceiver/internal/scraper/cpuscraper/documentation.md"
   ],
   "note": "optional metric of the hostmetrics cpu scraper: enable it; Google averages over cores and keeps the state label. Google reports percent (0-100); the OpenTelemetry metric is a ratio (0-1), so a Google threshold is divided by 100."
  },
